#
# The permissions the APK may hold, one per line: every permission the
# merged manifest of the debug and of the release variant names, the
# ones a library's own manifest merges in included. verify<Variant>
# MergedPermissions (build.gradle.kts) fails the assemble on any other,
# and tools/checks/check_android_contacts_and_backup.py fails when this
# list and its own (plan section 29 step 2's) differ. A permission enters
# an APK an assemble builds, debug or release, only through a record that
# names it there, then here; verifyMergedPermissionsRefusal holds the
# build's check to manifests planted to fail it.
#
# Written 2026-11-16 from main's merged manifests at 8d8165e8d, both
# variants: the seven below, and no <permission> of the app's own.
android.permission.INTERNET
android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE
android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE
android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_REMOTE_MESSAGING
android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
android.permission.USE_BIOMETRIC
android.permission.CAMERA
